# MPLAB X build outputs
build/
dist/
debug/
production/
*.elf
*.hex
*.hxl
*.cof
*.map
*.lst
*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.i
*.s

# MPLAB X generated makefiles and local state.
#
# Listed individually rather than as Makefile*.mk, matching the sonora AK repo:
# the blanket glob also swallowed Makefile-variables.mk, which is NOT generated
# per-configuration and IS worth tracking -- it is where the configuration list
# and the shared output paths live, so a diff on it shows a configuration being
# added or renamed. Everything below is re-created by prjMakefilesGenerator on
# demand (buildtools/build.ps1 runs it), so committing it would only produce churn.
firmware.X/.generated_files/
firmware.X/nbproject/Makefile-CK*.mk
firmware.X/nbproject/Makefile-local-*.mk
firmware.X/nbproject/Makefile-impl.mk
firmware.X/nbproject/Makefile-genesis.properties
firmware.X/nbproject/private/
MPLABXLog.xml
MPLABXLog.xml.lck

# Flash/reset tool binaries: the ~68 MB self-contained exes are NOT vendored in
# this repo. flashauto.ps1 resolves them from the shared vscode-home/_flash_reset_tools
# (sibling) or -ToolsDir / $FLASH_RESET_TOOLS. Keep any local copy out of git.
buildtools/_flash_reset_tools/

# Local editor / OS noise
.vs/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# The in-repo copy of the serial monitor is gone -- the tool lives once, in the
# sibling serial-monitor/ repo. The whole directory stays ignored rather than the
# three former subdirectories, because `git rm` leaves untracked logs and caches
# behind: narrowing this would un-ignore console logs in any clone that still has
# leftovers, and one `git add -A` would then commit them.
tools/serial_monitor/

# Offline AVAS model / host bit-exactness harness: caches and host binaries
tools/__pycache__/
tools/host_check/*.exe
tools/host_check/avas_type_ty_ck_dump

# Phase-0 const-cost probe: a MEASUREMENT input, regenerated per size by
# tools/gen_avas_type_lb_const_probe.py and never part of an image (it needs
# -Define AVAS_TYPE_LB_CK_CONST_PROBE=1). Committing it would put ~900 lines of
# provisional integers in the tree that look like a coefficient table and are not.
src/app/dsp/avas_type_lb_ck_const_probe.h

# Python bytecode, anywhere (the host_check tools import each other, so this is
# generated by simply running them -- the narrower tools/__pycache__/ rule above
# did not reach tools/host_check/).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
